    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The immensely popular fictional railway \u201cKowa Railway,\u201d known from YouTube, is finally becoming a game!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy completely freeform driving with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No scoring!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No automatic braking!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total freedom to operate as you like!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Modes to Choose From</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Driving Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop or pass stations at will, open the doors, play onboard announcements\u2014do whatever you like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultra High-Speed Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience breakneck speeds soaring past <strong>1,000 km/h</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boasting a total of <strong>500,000 views</strong> on YouTube, Kowa Railway is now yours to explore in a fresh, new kind of train-driving experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want as many people as possible to enjoy our games, so <strong>all MFC STUDIO titles are freely available for streaming and video content</strong>. If you have any questions or issues while streaming, feel free to contact <strong>@Shinise3</strong> on X.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone\u2014individuals or companies\u2014can stream or post videos without needing prior approval.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the game\u2019s name in your video/stream title or provide a link to the Steam page in your description.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The immensely popular fictional railway \u201cKowa Railway,\u201d known from YouTube, is finally becoming a game!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy completely freeform driving with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No scoring!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No automatic braking!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total freedom to operate as you like!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Modes to Choose From</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Driving Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop or pass stations at will, open the doors, play onboard announcements\u2014do whatever you like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultra High-Speed Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience breakneck speeds soaring past <strong>1,000 km/h</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boasting a total of <strong>500,000 views</strong> on YouTube, Kowa Railway is now yours to explore in a fresh, new kind of train-driving experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want as many people as possible to enjoy our games, so <strong>all MFC STUDIO titles are freely available for streaming and video content</strong>. If you have any questions or issues while streaming, feel free to contact <strong>@Shinise3</strong> on X.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone\u2014individuals or companies\u2014can stream or post videos without needing prior approval.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the game\u2019s name in your video/stream title or provide a link to the Steam page in your description.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The popular imaginary railway \u201cKowa Railway\u201d from YouTube is finally making its game debut! Experience its 11-station route in realistic free driving mode or by blasting past 1,000 km/h in high-speed mode. Enjoy every inch of this dynamic line as you operate your train your way!",
